  "Number": 10,
  "Question": "The sum of \\(49\\) consecutive integers is \\(7^5.\\) What is their median?",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(7\\)",
    "B": "\\(7^2\\)",
    "C": "\\(7^3\\)",
    "D": "\\(7^4\\)",
    "E": "\\(7^5\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Solution": "There are \\(49\\) integers, so the median is the 25th integer in increasing order. Call it \\(m\\). The other integers form 24 pairs equally far from \\(m\\): for each \\(k=1,\\ldots,24\\), the pair \\(m-k\\) and \\(m+k\\) has sum \\(2m\\).\n\nIncluding the median itself, the total is therefore\n\\[\n24(2m)+m=49m=7^5.\n\\]\nSince \\(49=7^2\\),\n\\[\nm=\\frac{7^5}{7^2}=7^3=343.\n\\]\nThe median is \\(\\boxed{343}\\), choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{C}}\\).",
